  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/63062F">Definition <span data-tag="63062F">7.1.6.1</span>.</a>pro-spaceshapeProSSet@$\Pro (\SSet )$ We let $\Pro (\SSet )$ denote the full subcategory of $\Fun (\SSet , \SSet )^{op}$ spanned by left exact, accessible functors $f: \SSet \rightarrow \SSet $. We will refer to $\Pro (\SSet )$ as the $\infty $-category of <em>pro-spaces</em>, or as the $\infty $-category of <em>shapes</em>. </p>
